  "description": "In a village during the Joseon Dynasty, Do-Ryeong, a popular nobleman, has a secret he can't tell... He comes too quickly, and recovers too fast! \n\nDo-Ryeong the rabbit, who suffers from unfulfilled sexual desire every day, accidentally witnesses his housekeeper Turtle's sex scene. He secretly summons him, expecting that if he really is a \"turtle\", he will satisfy him. However, the turtle suddenly makes a bet...!\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Jeollaeyahandonghwa (전래야한동화) Collection.*",
